<section class="legal-body">
  <div class="container">
    <p>The Courts is committed to creating an inclusive experience, both in our facility and online.</p>
    <p>We are working to make playthecourts.com accessible and usable for people of all abilities and will continue improving the site as our programs and digital experiences grow.</p>

    <section>
      <h2>Our Accessibility Efforts</h2>
      <p>Our accessibility efforts include attention to areas such as:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Keyboard navigation</li>
        <li>Screen-reader compatibility</li>
        <li>Text and color contrast</li>
        <li>Alternative text for meaningful images</li>
        <li>Clear headings and page structure</li>
        <li>Accessible forms and error messages</li>
        <li>Captions or alternatives for meaningful video content</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Need Help?</h2>
      <p>If you have difficulty accessing any part of our website, need information in another format, or need assistance registering for a Courts program, please reach out. We want to help.</p>
      <p><a href="mailto:hello@playthecourts.com">hello@playthecourts.com</a></p>
      <p>When contacting us, please let us know what you were trying to access and what would make it easier for you.</p>
      <p>The Courts, LLC<br>Nolensville, Tennessee</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>

